 "best_idea": "A per-attacker hate table keeps damage, aggro and heal apart, holds the last pick until it dies or a timer runs out, and lets taunt or focus flags override the pick at once.",
 "decision": "adapt",
 "decision_why": "Frankendom needs a server-chosen target for many-on-one fights (MAX_ATTACKERS = 3). The hate table, taunt/focus override and re-evaluate-on-state-change fit; the donor's random weighted pool and 24 s hold do not give replayable, server-verified fights.",
 "decision_status": "proposed",
 "acceptance": "In a 3-on-1 server test, when a second attacker's damage passes the boss's current target, the boss's target changes on the next server tick (not after a 24 s hold); a taunt flag changes it at once; the test fails if the target is unchanged after two ticks with no taunt."
